          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">the friendship of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gilgamesh">Gilgamesh</a> and Enkidu; the killing of Humbaba in the Cedar Forest; the Bull of Heaven; Gilgamesh's quest for eternal life; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ziusudra">Utnapishtim</a>'s account of the flood; the plant of youth stolen by a serpent; parallels with the Genesis flood narrative</span></div>
